<![CDATA[<div><font face="arial" style="font-size: 12pt;">{!Lead.FirstName},</font><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><div><font face="arial">As promised, here is contact info for one of best lenders. Your next step is to complete the online application for financing. Once you are pre-approved, we will be ready to start building your portfolio together.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><b><br><a href="http://rsansonetti.blueleaflending.com/"><font color="#3366ff">Please use the link included in Charlie Hillemann's contact info</font></a>&nbsp;</b>below and complete the application. Charlie's team will reach out to you within 48 hours of receiving your application to introduce themselves and help you obtain the financing approval.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div>Let me know as soon as you receive your approval for financing, and schedule a call with me using the link in my email as soon you are approved so that we can begin review properties as the become available.</div><div><br></div><div><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Thanks,</span></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Ashley&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div></div></div><div><table class="m_-2332670310265357790MsoNormalTable" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-collapse: collapse;"><tbody><tr style="height: 83.25pt;"><td style="margin: 0px; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 83.25pt;"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 14.72px;"><b><span style="font-family: Corbel, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 47, 80); text-transform: uppercase;">CHARLIE HILLEMANN</span></b><span style="font-size: 10pt; line-height: 15.3333px; font-family: Corbel, sans-serif; color: rgb(89, 89, 89);">&nbsp; |&nbsp;&nbsp;<i>Executive Vice President</i></span><span style="font-size: 10pt; line-height: 15.3333px; font-family: Corbel, sans-serif; color: rgb(89, 89, 89);"><u></u><u></u></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 14.72px;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; line-height: 15.3333px; font-family: Corbel, sans-serif; color: rgb(89, 89, 89);">12655 Olive Boulevard, Suite 250&nbsp; |&nbsp; Creve Coeur, MO 63141<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 14.72px;"><b><span style="font-size: 11pt; line-height: 16.8667px; font-family: Corbel, sans-serif; color: rgb(31, 73, 125);"><a href="tel:(314)%20317-6970" value="+13143176970" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204);">(314) 317-6970</a></span></b><span style="font-size: 10pt; line-height: 15.3333px; font-family: Corbel, sans-serif; color: rgb(31, 73, 125);">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 10pt; line-height: 15.3333px; font-family: Corbel, sans-serif; color: rgb(89, 89, 89);">|&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="tel:(866)%20634-9290" value="+18666349290" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204);">(866) 634-9290</a>&nbsp;fax&nbsp; |&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 9pt; line-height: 13.8px; font-family: Corbel, sans-serif; color: rgb(89, 89, 89);">NMLS #</span><span style="font-size: 10pt; line-height: 15.3333px; font-family: Corbel, sans-serif; color: rgb(89, 89, 89);">438481<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 14.72px;"><b><span style="font-size: 11pt; line-height: 16.8667px; font-family: Corbel, sans-serif; color: rgb(89, 89, 89);"><span style="color: blue;"><a href="mailto:chillemann@stifelbank.com" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204);">chillemann@stifelbank.com</a></span><u></u><u></u></span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 14.72px;"><span style="line-height: 16.8667px; font-family: Corbel, sans-serif; color: rgb(89, 89, 8